r approximately 57% of our consolidated net revenues during each of 2025 and 2024. Net revenues from our behavioral health care facilities and commercial health insurer accounted for approximately 43% of our consolidated net revenues during each of 2025 and 2024.","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The health care industry is highly competitive. In recent years, competition among healthcare providers for patients has intensified in the United States due to, among other things, regulatory and technological changes, increasing use of managed care payment systems, cost containment pressures and a shift toward outpatient treatment. In all of the geographical areas in which we operate, there are other facilities that provide services comparable to those offered by our facilities. In addition, some of our competitors include hospitals that are owned by tax-supported governmental agencies or by nonprofit corporations and may be supported by endowments and charitable contributions and exempt from property, sale and income taxes. Such exemptions and support are not available to us.","zh":null},{"en":"In some markets, certain of our competitors may have greater financial resources, be better equipped and offer a broader range of services than us. Certain hospitals that are located in the areas served by our facilities are specialty or large hospitals that provide medical, surgical and behavioral health services, facilities and equipment that are not available at our hospitals. The increase in","zh":null}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Acute Care Hospital Services","val":9925907000,"zh":"Acute Care Hospital Services"},{"name":"Behavioral Health Services","val":7425500000,"zh":"Behavioral Health Services"},{"name":"State Medicaid Programs","val":56000000,"zh":"State Medicaid Programs"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":13422000,"zh":"All Other Segments"}],"total":17364829000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Managed Care","val":4902096000,"zh":"Managed Care"},{"name":"Medicaid","val":2686967000,"zh":"Medicaid"},{"name":"Managed Medicaid","val":2482601000,"zh":"Managed Medicaid"},{"name":"Managed Medicare","val":2080278000,"zh":"Managed Medicare"},{"name":"Medicare","val":1856404000,"zh":"Medicare"},{"name":"Other Patient Revenue & Adjustments Net","val":1240278000,"zh":"Other Patient Revenue & Adjustments Net"},{"name":"Other Non Patient Revenue","val":1114849000,"zh":"Other Non Patient Revenue"},{"name":"UK Revenue","val":1001356000,"zh":"UK Revenue"}],"total":17364829000}},"peers":["HCA","TFX","COO","THC","HSIC"]}}